  {
   "id": "yakuza-kiwami-3-368182@1.13",
   "gameId": "yakuza-kiwami-3-368182",
   "displayName": "PATCH 1.13",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-02-20T17:32:13.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "[p align=\"start\"]Thank you very much for playing Yakuza Kiwami 3 & Dark Ties.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Patch 1.13, released today, includes the following fixes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "▼Patch Details",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Yakuza Kiwami 3",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Fixed an issue in Chapter 9 where loading save data in Purgatory would change the in-game time to night and block story progression.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "*If this issue is occurring, applying Patch 1.13 and then saving/loading in Kamurocho will allow the story to progress normally.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "*If you are currently in Downtown Ryukyu, please go to Kamurocho and save/load to fix the issue.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Fixed an issue in Downtown Ryukyu where triggering another event during the Okinawa Soba Delivery substory would make it impossible to progress.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Dark Ties",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Fixed an issue in Chapter 2: Head to Hell’s Arena, where beating the Trial of Demise in Survival Hell for the first time would prevent further progression.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Yakuza Kiwami 3 & Dark Ties",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Fixed an issue where the game could crash when placing large bets at the casino roulette.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Improved text subtitles and localization issues.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Various other bug fixes improving stability and overall quality.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Fixed an issue where repeated play of certain minigames under specific environments could cause performance drops.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "・Fixed Steam-specific issues and improved overall stability.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
